   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the local finance law, in relation to bonds and notes of the city of Yonkers",
    "basePrintNo": "S1759",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S1759-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §54.40, Loc Fin L",
    "lawSection": "Local Finance Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S 1759\n\n TITLE OF BILL :  An act to amend the local finance law, in relation\nto bonds and notes of the city of Yonkers\n\n PURPOSE :\n\nExtender law - this bill extends the marketing limitation on serial\nbonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2017 to June 30, 2018\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\n\n\nSection one of the bill amends Section 54.40 of the local finance law\nas amended by chapter 45 of the laws of 2016 to extend the city's\nauthorization to issue bonds and notes through negotiated sale to June\n30, 2018\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nExtender law - this bill extends the marketing limitation on serial\nbonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2017 to June 30, 2018. The\nauthorization for Yonkers to negotiate the private sales of its bonds\nor notes is vital to improving the city's financial stability and\nindependence. The city's bonding authority will expire on June 30,\n2017 unless it is extended for one year. The continuation of this\npower will allow more cost-effective financing for the city of\nYonkers.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\n2016 - S6355 Chapter 45;\n2015 - S3463 Chapter 21;\n2014 - S6313 Chapter 70;\n2013 - S3020 Chapter 69;\n2012 - S6460 Chapter 72;\n2011 - S2982 Chapter 66;\n2010 - S6720 Chapter 125;\n2009 - S3336 Chapter 77;\n2008 S6878 Chapter 144\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nNone to the State.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect immediately\n",
